  lines:
  - lineId: 17F04_ChristmasPhoto_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: This one's from last week. Lily's sitting under her desk lamp, holding
      a certificate. The home unit took it. You're not in the picture.
    holdSeconds: 10.206603
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3778f99b6666f5340a1e391c5adf8cc5, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F04_ChristmasPhoto_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Her smile-stability score is actually higher here than in the Christmas
      photo. Since the home unit came online, her overall emotional stability has
      gone up twenty-three point four percent.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db1571726f15135428049962103ef1a8, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F04_ChristmasPhoto_FieldUnit_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That is one measurable benefit to this household.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5cd3b0dc40d58241b1b22dff1157e4c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
